    "I like watching movies.": ["I like watching movies on the weekends.","Me gusta ver películas los fines de semana."],
    "I've been learning English for a year.": ["I've been learning English for a year, but speaking is still hard.","Llevo un año estudiando inglés, pero hablar todavía me cuesta."],
    "Thanks a lot.": ["Thanks a lot for your help today.","Muchas gracias por tu ayuda hoy."],
    "I speak a little English.": ["Sorry, I only speak a little English.","Perdón, solo hablo un poco de inglés."],
    "What does this mean?": ["What does this word on the sign mean?","¿Qué significa esta palabra del letrero?"],
    "How much is this?": ["How much is this T-shirt?","¿Cuánto cuesta esta camiseta?"],
    "Can I pay by card?": ["Can I pay by card, or is it cash only?","¿Puedo pagar con tarjeta o solo aceptan efectivo?"],
    "Just a second.": ["Just a second, I'm almost done.","Un segundo, ya casi termino."],
    "I'm not sure.": ["I'm not sure, but I think it's on the second floor.","No estoy seguro, pero creo que está en el segundo piso."],
    "It's next to the bank.": ["The café is next to the bank on Main Street.","La cafetería está al lado del banco, en Main Street."],
    "Turn left at the corner.": ["Turn left at the corner, and you'll see the station.","Gira a la izquierda en la esquina y verás la estación."],
    "Where do I transfer?": ["Where do I transfer to get to Union Station?","¿Dónde hago transbordo para llegar a Union Station?"],
    "Can I get a Coke?": ["Can I get a Coke with no ice?","¿Me da una Coca-Cola sin hielo?"],
    "Is it spicy?": ["Is it spicy? I can't handle spicy food.","¿Pica? No aguanto la comida picante."],
    "Can we split the bill?": ["Can we split the bill three ways?","¿Podemos dividir la cuenta entre tres?"],
    "Can I get this to go?": ["I can't finish this. Can I get this to go?","No puedo terminarme esto. ¿Me lo pone para llevar?"],
    "Less ice, please.": ["Can I get a large iced latte? Less ice, please.","¿Me da un latte grande con hielo? Con poco hielo, por favor."],
    "Can I get a receipt?": ["Can I get a receipt? It's for work.","¿Me da el recibo? Es para el trabajo."],
    "Is this on sale?": ["Is this jacket on sale?","¿Esta chaqueta está en oferta?"],
